  "text": "Across the tc ladder (shared RoCE NIC, shaped 1 -> 50 Gbit/s) the two models make IDENTICAL predictions, because CL-012.D S3 (intensity) was not implemented. Both are monotone decreasing in shaped rate (H_dur). The tc ladder therefore CANNOT discriminate the fabric-aware model from the fabric-blind one: it can only falsify or fail to falsify H_dur, which both share.",
